# TODO Tracking

At the **start** of every session, read `TODO.md` in the project root.
At the **end** of every session where tasks were completed, update
`TODO.md`:
- Mark completed items with `[x]`.
- Mark in-progress items with `[~]`.
- Add new items discovered during the session.
- Update the "Последнее обновление" timestamp.

Do NOT remove completed items — they serve as a changelog.
Do NOT create a separate TODO file — `TODO.md` is the single source.
